{#
  Compatibility route for the original Speedlify's API.

  A `<speedlify-score>` component with no `hash` attribute fetches this to turn a
  URL into one, then requests /api/<hash>.json. Without it that path 404s and the
  component fails outright.

  Deliberately minimal: the component reads `.hash` and nothing else, so nothing
  else is emitted. The original also carries requestedUrl, url, categories and
  vertical here — absent, because no consumer fails without them.

  Keyed by the URL as a bare string. The lookup is `json[url]` with no
  normalization at all, so a key only matches an embed that spells the URL
  exactly this way.
-#}
{
{%- for entry in sites.entries %}
  {{ entry.url | dump | safe }}: { "hash": {{ entry.shortHash | dump | safe }} }{{ "," if not loop.last }}
{%- endfor %}
}
